--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Initial Color
     ↓
useState(initialColor)
     ↓
Current color
     ↓
User Requests New Quote
     ↓
getRandomColor()
     ↓
setColor(newColor)
     ↓
React Re-renders
     ↓
New Color Applied to UI


