PART 4: UPDATING QUOTE AND COLOR STATE
================================================================================

UPDATE QUOTE AND COLOR TOGETHER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

const getNewQuote = async () => {

  setLoading(true)

  setError(null)


  try {

    // Fetch new quote

    const newQuote =
      await fetchRandomQuote()


    // Update quote

    setQuote(newQuote)


    // Update theme color

    setColor(
      getRandomColor()
    )


    console.log(
      'Quote fetched successfully:',
      newQuote
    )

  } catch (err) {

    setError(
      'Failed to fetch quote. Please try again.'
    )


    console.error(
      'Error fetching quote:',
      err
    )

  } finally {

    setLoading(false)

  }
}


WHAT THIS DOES
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

• Starts loading

• Clears the previous error

• Requests a quote

• Updates quote state after success

• Chooses a random color

• Updates color state

• Stops loading after completion

• Causes the UI to reflect the resulting state


================================================================================
STATE UPDATE COORDINATION
================================================================================

+----------------+------------------------+-----------------------------+
| STATE          | UPDATE MOMENT          | NEXT VALUE                  |
+----------------+------------------------+-----------------------------+
| loading        | Request begins         | true                        |
| error          | Request begins         | null                        |
| quote          | Successful request     | New quote                   |
| color          | Successful request     | Random palette color        |
| error          | Failed request         | Error message               |
| loading        | Request completes      | false                       |
+----------------+------------------------+-----------------------------+


