================================================================================
MULTIPLE STATE UPDATES
================================================================================

Calling:

setQuote(newQuote)

and:

setColor(newColor)

does NOT mean you should manually call a render function.

React manages rendering after state updates.

In modern React, multiple state updates occurring in the same operation can
also be batched.


