================================================================================
ABOUT ${color}cc
================================================================================

For a six-digit hexadecimal color such as:

#667eea

appending:

cc

creates an eight-digit hexadecimal color:

#667eeacc


The final two hexadecimal digits represent alpha.


cc corresponds to approximately:

80% opacity


IMPORTANT:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This technique assumes color contains a compatible six-digit hexadecimal
value.

It would not work correctly by blindly appending "cc" to values such as:

'red'

'rgb(102, 126, 234)'


For this lesson, COLORS contains six-digit hex colors, so the approach is
appropriate.


