IMPORTANT TESTING CORRECTION
================================================================================

Do NOT write a test that assumes:

"One click must always produce a different color."

Because the selection is random, the same color can legally be selected again.

Better options:

1. Mock Math.random() with a known value

or

2. Inject a predictable color-selection function

or

3. Test that the rendered style uses the selected color


